WEBVTT

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.690
Two Months Ago

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:05.310
The great Tokyo land-rise...

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:08.870
...its cause can be traced to that day, two months ago.

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:30.130
Limiter released...

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:32.000
Memory accessed...

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:34.400
My name is Arma...

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:37.280
...of the Trinary Solar System.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:47.020
My life... shall end... high up in this sky.

00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:48.080
Not yet!

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.490
You are the Trinary Solar System's No. 1 warrior.

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:53.430
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:56.330
Your battle is not yet over.

00:00:56.730 --> 00:00:58.670
My battle, you say?

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:01.630
Have you forgotten what our goal was?

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:05.470
It was so long ago.

00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:08.070
I no longer remember anything.

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:12.270
Perhaps it can't be helped, now that you've become one of the Zonderians.

00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:15.010
Who are you?

00:01:15.690 --> 00:01:18.620
I'll help you to remember... everything.

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:28.690
Templum, mundus, infini, tum, redire!

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:40.500
I no longer have enough energy to regenerate my body.

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:43.100
I suppose this is it for me.

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:44.010
Not yet!

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:44.840
Huh?

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:49.750
Penchinon, you must go back to being who you truly are, just as I have.

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:52.680
And then let us fight together!

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:53.380
Huh?

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:55.080
As Abel's warriors!

00:01:55.530 --> 00:01:56.690
Arma...

00:01:56.890 --> 00:01:58.520
And Pizza?

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:00.330
I am not Pizza.

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:03.760
My name is Soldatoo-J!

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:08.300
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:11.200
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:17.860
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:22.820
Run, you powerful Robot Brigade!

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:29.050
With your red gaze and your silver chest!

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:33.140
The G-Stone is your bond with the lion

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:37.840
to save the future of outer space.

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:41.800
It's time to launch!

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:44.980
Destroying the souls of the people...

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:48.900
Smash the Zonder Metal to pieces!

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:53.600
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:56.560
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:56.560 --> 00:02:59.480
}Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:02.230
Now transform into a superhero!

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:05.740
Pulverizing steel!

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:09.410
Goldion Hammer!

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:16.940
Magic! Drive! Ultimate power! Guts!

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:22.940
A hero is born! Great God of Iron...

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:25.760
Our very own King of Braves!

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:29.940
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:33.950
You are hereby ordered to fuse with the Ultimate King of Braves legend!

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:36.870
The Brave Heroes Resurrected

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:39.560
<i>The Brave Heroes Resurrected!</i>

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:44.100
Plasma Sword!

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:52.970
One of the remaining 28 of the 31 Machine Primevals...

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:56.570
...has fused with an offshore plant in the Arctic Ocean.

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:59.210
This was quickly detected by Soldatoo-J...

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:03.580
...who set off in the J-Ark with the boy, Kaidou, as well as Mamoru, on board.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:05.980
But the enemy has launched a powerful attack...

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:09.120
...by generating absolute zero temperatures, and the J-Ark...

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:12.530
...ends up sinking into the icy ocean.

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:17.860
We can't let it get near the North Pole!

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:20.970
If the Earth's magnetic field is extinguished...

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:25.030
...the Van Allen Belt will dissipate and Earth will turn into a planet of death!

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:27.070
Division I!

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:30.470
What's the status on the Ul-Tech Engine Drive Space Carrier Base, Izanagi?

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:32.380
It's about to enter the Earth's atmosphere.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:34.850
Until the Brave Robots awaken...

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:37.410
...the only ones who can save mankind from this crisis...

00:04:37.490 --> 00:04:40.290
...are Gai and Galeon, as well as Mic!

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:46.220
Huh?

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:49.790
Is this inside the white battleship?

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:56.930
Ouch!

00:04:57.240 --> 00:04:58.430
What is this?

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:00.770
This is a really weird kind of hallway!

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:08.140
We're in the ocean?

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:14.820
Mamoru's late, isn't he?

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:17.990
I'm sure he's busy playing with his friends.

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:19.290
But...

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:22.990
When he gets hungry he'll come straight home!

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:25.430
After all, this is Mamoru's home, isn't it?

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:27.470
Yes, you're right.

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:28.900
Huh?

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:30.840
What's wrong?

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:32.860
L-Look!

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:35.740
Wh-What in the world is that?

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:41.880
An aurora?

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:45.710
I wonder where Kaidou is?

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:55.530
But if I remember right, that's...

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:07.670
That thing from the other day...

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:09.110
So you've seen it.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:11.150
Kaidou!

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:13.310
That's a Zonder Crystal.

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:15.270
Zonder Crystal?

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:16.410
That's right.

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:21.320
And when we've collected all of them, we'll have achieved our goal.

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:22.920
What do you mean, your goal?

00:06:22.990 --> 00:06:26.830
You were created by Cain, and you don't even know what I'm talking about?

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:32.160
So you've come this far, the Machine of Destruction created by Cain?

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:34.160
Who the heck is this Cain, anyway?

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:36.530
You're in the same boat as me.

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:37.370
Huh?

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:40.300
Your memory has been sealed.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:46.750
An aurora has been detected in the major cities of the Northern Hemisphere.

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:50.610
Earth is protected from the powerful solar wind by...

00:06:50.690 --> 00:06:53.180
...an invisible shield created by its magnetic field.

00:06:53.560 --> 00:06:58.320
An aurora is caused by solar wind plasma colliding with the atmosphere.

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:01.060
The fact that we're seeing such a huge amount...

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:02.960
It proves that the Earth's shield...

00:07:03.030 --> 00:07:06.520
...is being stripped away by ZX-04's electromagnetic wave.

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:10.770
That powerful electromagnetic wave would stop any kind of...

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:13.470
...electronic equipment from working near ZX-04.

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:17.440
But by using the Baribarien's Atmospheric Entry System as a shield...

00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:20.510
...Mic should be able to get just close enough to the enemy.

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:23.410
You mean he can't use Disc X?

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:25.320
That would be way too dangerous!

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:25.940
What?

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:29.860
Since we don't have any real data on the 31 Machine Primevals...

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:33.390
If we tried using the Solitary Wave Riser here on Earth...

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:36.260
...it could easily end up destroying Earth itself!

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:38.330
Gai...

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:43.270
I've just received a signal from Mamoru.

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:46.240
Code 10-3-4. It's an emergency alert.

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:48.040
Where's the signal coming from?

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:49.080
The Arctic Ocean!

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:49.900
What?

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:52.040
Gai! We're changing the operation!

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:52.980
What's going on?

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:54.610
Mamoru's nearby!

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:57.920
We need you and Mic to split up and search for him!

00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:00.550
Oh! Don't tell me Mamoru's been captured by the enemy!

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:04.350
I know you're not fully adjusted yet, but you and Galeon have to go now!

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:05.360
Roger!

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:07.500
Fusion!

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:12.920
GaiGar!

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:22.570
The coldest place on earth!

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:24.670
I've got to hurry or Mamoru could die!

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:33.690
Mamoru!

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:40.190
Those 31 Primevals! Taking Mamoru hostage!

00:08:44.230 --> 00:08:44.760
What's that?

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:46.600
Stand up!

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:54.570
J-Der!

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:00.770
It's been a long time...

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:02.380
Cyborg...

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:03.350
...Gai!

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:04.110
That voice!

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.220
You're one of the Four Machine Kings, Pizza!

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:14.130
J-Ark... existence confirmed.

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:17.560
Unable to anticipate its next move.

00:09:18.130 --> 00:09:20.230
Now interacting with the cyborg.

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:22.060
G and J.

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:24.260
Green and red.

00:09:24.570 --> 00:09:27.060
I don't know how you managed to survive, but...

00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:30.940
...if you've taken Mamoru hostage, you're even worse than I thought, Pizza!

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:33.350
You're wrong on two counts.

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:34.380
What?

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:39.250
Number 1. Right now, I'm J-Der, the fused version of Soldatoo-J.

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:41.420
I've abandoned the name Pizza.

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:43.620
And Number 2.

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:46.990
A true warrior never takes hostages.

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:49.860
You think I'm gonna believe you?

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:54.270
I'm gonna take back Mamoru even if it takes every ounce of my strength!

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:58.160
That's your 3rd mistake. You can never hope to defeat me!

00:09:58.610 --> 00:09:59.870
Don't give me that!

00:10:02.550 --> 00:10:03.150
So fast!

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:04.170
No.

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:05.440
It's just that you're too slow.

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:06.810
What?

00:10:10.890 --> 00:10:12.410
What's the matter, Galeon?

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:14.150
Big Brother Gai!

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:16.520
Please, stop! Big Brother Gai!

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:17.550
Mamoru?

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:20.220
Soldatoo-J hasn't done anything to me!

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:23.130
Thank goodness. So you're okay!

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:25.500
Plasma Wing!

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:28.630
We'll settle this one of these days.

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:30.500
Farewell, Gai!

00:10:31.070 --> 00:10:32.010
You're not getting away!

00:10:32.070 --> 00:10:33.170
Wait, Big Brother Gai!

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:36.570
We've got to try to stop the 31 Primevals first!

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:38.750
Pizza...

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:40.710
No, Soldatoo-J...

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:44.510
So you're not one of the 31 Primevals, after all.

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:47.920
Okay! Mamoru, will you fight with me now?

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:50.150
Sure, of course I will!

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.470
Found it! Mic!

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:07.670
Oh! It's a lot bigger than the Primevals we saw before!

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:10.210
Well, it's fused with this planet's machines.

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:12.540
These electromagnetic waves are so strong!

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:14.340
All right! Time for Mirror-Coating!

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:15.680
Okay, you got it!

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:21.750
All right, just keep blasting through those electromagnetic waves!

00:11:22.420 --> 00:11:25.290
Good luck, Mic, Big Brother Gai!

00:11:31.930 --> 00:11:33.060
Now, Mic!

00:11:33.270 --> 00:11:34.030
Okay!

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:37.740
System Change!

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:44.600
Sound standby!

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:49.280
Disc M!

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:51.280
Set on!

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:53.720
Razzle-Dazzle Double V!

00:11:54.890 --> 00:11:58.790
The music emanating from Disc M is delivering tremendous microwaves...

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:00.890
...that have the power to paralyze certain mecha functions.

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:03.320
That's good, it's stopping now!

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:04.130
Now!

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:08.570
No!

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:15.710
It's no good! Get away!

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:27.980
GaiGar!

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:34.200
Oh, no!

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:37.020
Mic!

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:38.600
Dammit!

00:12:38.930 --> 00:12:40.900
Mic! GaiGar!

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:49.100
Dammit! It's hiding behind that ice fortress!

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:51.270
Damn!

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:53.580
Mamoru! Get yourself off this ship right now!

00:12:54.720 --> 00:12:56.710
I'm gonna crash Izanagi into the enemy!

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:57.510
But...

00:12:57.820 --> 00:12:58.810
Just do it!

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:01.720
Big Brother Gai...

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:03.750
Huh? What's that?

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:05.690
Huh?

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:10.230
Division IV. Amaterasu!

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:16.070
Is that an aurora?

00:13:16.740 --> 00:13:18.070
So beautiful...

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:22.140
Even though it's nothing but shimmering plasma...

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:24.870
Now that it's come to this...

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:27.410
If only I had those guys with me.

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:33.650
The sound of a siren?

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:36.460
Am I hallucinating?

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:38.850
What a familiar sound...

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:46.330
No, wait! This siren's got to be...

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:48.640
System Change!

00:13:51.610 --> 00:13:53.970
Volfogg!

00:13:55.210 --> 00:13:56.010
GunDober!

00:14:02.220 --> 00:14:02.840
GunGlue!

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:09.020
Three Become One!

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:22.640
Big Volfogg!

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:26.040
Mirror Coating!

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:31.770
Big Volfogg!

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:34.410
Murasame Sword!

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:44.420
Forgive me for being tardy. Allow me to take your place for now.

00:14:45.060 --> 00:14:47.090
I've been waiting for you, Big Volfogg!

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:48.360
What about Mic?

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:52.630
I owe you one, HyoRyu!

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:03.280
EnRyu!

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:09.240
I thought I'd be able to land right in vehicle mode, but...

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:11.850
There's no time to lose, EnRyu!

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:13.790
I know, I know, HyoRyu!

00:15:14.090 --> 00:15:15.820
System Change!

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:24.130
HyoRyu!

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:24.930
HyoRyu! EnRyu!

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:30.900
Chest Warmer!

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:37.780
Ul-Tech Rifle!

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:45.080
Big Volfogg!

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:47.050
HyoRyu! EnRyu!

00:15:47.690 --> 00:15:48.850
Thank goodness...

00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:51.390
You all woke up, huh?

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:56.820
When the world's in danger, they'll come to the rescue no matter what.

00:15:56.900 --> 00:15:59.030
Looks like the Brave Robots are all here!

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:02.070
Hey, Major! Better not forget about me!

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:13.170
System Change!

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:22.050
Goldymarg!

00:16:23.660 --> 00:16:24.590
Oh yeah!

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:26.030
Goldy woke up too?

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:35.260
Take this, you bastard!

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:41.100
Take that! Take that! Take that!

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:47.180
This is awesome! They've all come back!

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:50.480
So strong... they've all gotten a power-boost!

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:52.240
Thank goodness!

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:53.980
You guys!

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:55.580
You guys!

00:16:56.890 --> 00:16:59.660
Give it all you've got! The Ultimate Robot Brigade!

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:02.020
Disc P!

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:03.500
Version Up!

00:17:03.570 --> 00:17:05.290
Set on!

00:17:08.300 --> 00:17:11.360
Razzle-Dazzle Double V!

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:14.540
Message from Amaterasu.

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:16.740
They've completed the repairs on the GaoMachines.

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:20.010
All right! Final Fusion, approved!

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:22.080
Program Drive!

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:28.380
The red one's made of raging fire.

00:17:29.350 --> 00:17:33.850
And he'll make the villains pay for sure.

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:40.270
His heart full of justice is burning hot!

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:46.010
The blue one's cool and amazing.

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:51.320
He's got the power to freeze the enemy in their tracks.

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:58.050
There's a hidden anger inside of him!

00:17:57.190 --> 00:17:59.710
Symmetrical Docking!

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:06.330
As long as courage still exists in this world...

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:12.570
...our comrades will live eternally!

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:15.250
Go, go, go, go, go!

00:18:15.580 --> 00:18:18.040
Gi, gi, gi, gi, gi!

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:21.350
Those mecha bodies!

00:18:18.840 --> 00:18:23.300
ChoRyuJin!

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:23.750
Gan, gan, gan, ga-gan!

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:32.110
Fight on, you Brave Robot Brigade!

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:34.190
GaoGaiGar!

00:18:35.060 --> 00:18:38.520
So this is the upgraded GaoGaiGar equipped with the Ul-Tech Engine!

00:18:39.660 --> 00:18:40.920
I'm so psyched!

00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:42.850
Breaking the barrier!

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:46.480
The one who conceals himself in a purple mist...

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:43.720
Melting Siren!

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:45.760
Erase the electromagnetic waves!

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:52.110
...can race through the dark night in a flash.

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:52.630
Finishing move, Whirling Death Strike!

00:18:52.760 --> 00:18:58.110
His eyes can find the hidden truth!

00:18:58.480 --> 00:18:59.450
Whoa!

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:04.120
The orange one's the big guy.

00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:01.820
Broken Magnum!

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:09.580
The power flows from his hammer.

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:08.420
All right, GaoGaiGar!

00:19:08.490 --> 00:19:10.050
Use me now!

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:16.270
He's a tank that can make your soul tremble!

00:19:11.490 --> 00:19:12.820
All right!

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:14.920
Goldion Hammer!

00:19:15.430 --> 00:19:17.190
Launch approved!

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:24.300
As long as courage still exists in this world...

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:19.700
Roger!

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:24.600
Goldion Hammer... safety device... relieve!

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:30.900
...they're going to protect our happiness!

00:19:30.950 --> 00:19:33.160
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

00:19:33.450 --> 00:19:35.540
Hammer Connect!

00:19:33.850 --> 00:19:36.000
Gi! Gi! Gi! Gi! Gi!

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:39.550
Those mecha bodies!

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:41.850
Gan, gan, gan, ga-gan!

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:44.210
Goldion Hammer!

00:19:42.150 --> 00:19:50.820
Fight on, you Brave Robot Brigade!

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:51.830
Gai! You've got to yank out that thing's core!

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:54.830
If we can get our hands on the data for the 31 Machine Primevals...

00:19:54.900 --> 00:19:58.460
...we'll be able to destroy them with the Solitary Waves from Disc X!

00:19:58.670 --> 00:19:59.500
Roger!

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:05.540
Hammer Hell!

00:20:09.550 --> 00:20:12.580
Hammer Heaven!

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:20.390
Transform into light!

00:20:36.110 --> 00:20:37.700
GaoGaiGar...

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:39.310
...resurrected.

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:52.190
Thanks for coming back, you guys.

00:20:52.760 --> 00:20:56.490
Hey, how could we just lie around with the whole world in crisis?

00:20:56.800 --> 00:21:00.430
We cannot afford to rest until we finish the work that we started.

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:02.800
You guys, you're awesome!

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:06.130
Let's continue to fight... all of us fighting together!

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:09.600
All for the future of Earth!

00:21:12.510 --> 00:21:14.410
The Brave Robots have returned.

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:16.680
Mankind's survival... no...

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:20.690
Earth's future shall be saved by the Ultimate Brave Robot Brigade!

00:21:20.990 --> 00:21:26.260
At this moment, our heroes have carved out the path towards victory!

00:21:28.730 --> 00:21:30.530
Curatio!

00:21:31.230 --> 00:21:32.670
Teneritas!

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:34.370
Sectio!

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:36.300
Salus!

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:37.840
Coctura!

00:21:43.080 --> 00:21:45.340
It's no good! I can't Purify it!

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:48.110
Look out, Mamoru!

00:21:55.090 --> 00:21:57.680
Sorry, but I'm taking this Primeval core with me.

00:21:57.990 --> 00:21:58.620
What?

00:21:58.690 --> 00:21:59.630
King J-Der!

00:22:11.440 --> 00:22:12.740
J-Ark!

00:22:18.450 --> 00:22:20.240
What does he think he's doing?

00:22:20.420 --> 00:22:21.610
Should we go after him?

00:22:21.820 --> 00:22:24.250
No, he doesn't seem to be our enemy.

00:22:25.420 --> 00:22:27.080
What are you planning to do?

00:22:27.820 --> 00:22:28.810
Pizza...

00:22:28.890 --> 00:22:31.120
No, Soldatoo-J...

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:39.330
Kaidou was able to do it but I couldn't!

00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:50.450
Even if there are more than a million stars between us...

00:22:51.650 --> 00:22:55.320
...I know I can get there without losing my way.

00:22:56.720 --> 00:23:01.500
Because I can see the road that leads to you.

00:23:01.500 --> 00:23:06.290
It's sparkling ahead of me.

00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:10.460
The journey I began that day...

00:23:11.630 --> 00:23:17.390
...will surely make our bond even stronger.

00:23:19.450 --> 00:23:24.150
The wings that send me into the galaxy...

00:23:24.150 --> 00:23:28.810
...let's believe in them now.

00:23:29.500 --> 00:23:34.150
When you and I are grown up

00:23:34.150 --> 00:23:41.150
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:47.970
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.340 --> 00:23:51.070
The 31 Machine Primevals have transformed the Great Wall of China...

00:23:51.140 --> 00:23:53.730
...into the biggest cannon mankind has ever seen.

00:23:54.040 --> 00:23:56.410
The latest Brave Robots created in China...

00:23:56.480 --> 00:23:58.740
...FuRyu and RaiRyu, are about to mobilize!

00:23:58.850 --> 00:24:00.970
But can they work in harmony with the GGG robots...

00:24:01.050 --> 00:24:03.570
...and can their hearts be unlocked?

00:24:03.820 --> 00:24:05.880
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:05.950 --> 00:24:07.350
"Wind and Lightning"

00:24:06.160 --> 00:24:06.200
Wind and Lightning

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:10.620
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:11.920 --> 00:24:14.680
FuRyu and RaiRyu

00:24:12.830 --> 00:24:14.460
This is the Key to Victory!
